Archive the Page's Messenger conversations as chats, with up to the 20 most recent messages of each. Progress resumes on the next sync. Tokens come from the daemon environment.

Usage:
  msgvault source facebook-messages sync [identifier] [flags]

Flags:
      --build-cache[=true|false]      refresh analytics cache after this sync
      --full[=true|false]             restart from the most recent conversations; preserve and update archived rows
  -h, --help[=true|false]             help for sync
      --max-requests int              maximum API reads per inbox; each reads up to 25 conversations (default 1000)
      --no-build-cache[=true|false]   skip analytics cache refresh after this sync

Global Flags: --agent-allow-insecure, --agent-token-file, --agent-url, --config, --home, --local, --log-file, --log-level, --log-sql, --log-sql-slow-ms, --no-log-file, --remote, -v/--verbose (see 'msgvault --help')
